Brainstorming and Ideation Phase
The idea of FitBuddy was developed to solve the problem of creating a suitable fitness plan for each individual. Different people have different fitness goals, fitness levels, workout intensities and available workout times.
The main idea was to develop an AI-based fitness application that can collect the user's basic fitness information and use the Gemini AI model to generate a personalized 7-day fitness plan.
The system was planned to provide workout exercises, warm-up, rest, cool-down and recovery suggestions. It also provides general healthy eating and hydration tips.
The application also allows users to provide feedback on their generated plan. Based on the feedback, Gemini can generate an updated workout plan.
